SPOILERS

It seems like you are wearing a cloak of magic resistance or gray dragon
scale mail. Remove it before stepping on the teleporter. Ones you have 
stepped on previously should still be there and be operational.
Make sure you have teleport control before you do any of this. Then you
can choose the level you wish to teleport to. Eat a tengu corpse or find
or wish for a ring of teleport control.
Also make sure you have fire resistance before you go to hell, otherwise
you might find it a little too HOT.
Have you been to the castle yet? If not, go there first.
Lastly, a hint.
Before you leave the castle, apply a mirror to yourself while
blindfolded (repeatedly). You will get a message which will give you 
some indication of how far down in hell the wizard is residing. This may
save you from having to teleport as far down as level 50. (They say that
hell is a really boring place).

